1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,640
It's hotter than a hoochie coochie out here.
外面也太热了，热得要命。

2
00:00:02,500 --> 00:00:04,560
Why do you look completely unbothered by this heat?
你怎么一点都不受这天气影响？

3
00:00:04,580 --> 00:00:07,240
Because I came prepared. It's just a fan.
因为我有准备啊。——不就是个风扇吗？

4
00:00:07,420 --> 00:00:08,500
Yeah, that's what I thought, too.
对，我一开始也这么想。

5
00:00:08,501 --> 00:00:12,801
This has got 199 speeds. And the best part is this cold plate,
它有199档风速，最棒的是中间这块冷感面板，

6
00:00:13,060 --> 00:00:15,700
it's actually cold. So it's blowing cold air the entire time,
摸起来真的很凉，所以一直能吹出凉风，

7
00:00:15,701 --> 00:00:17,521
not like warm, stagnant air.
不会只是闷热的风。

8
00:00:17,580 --> 00:00:20,380
Wait, it's a fan that's actually blowing cold air
等等，它既能吹凉风，

9
00:00:20,381 --> 00:00:21,661
and actually cooling your skin?
又能让皮肤感到凉？

10
00:00:21,662 --> 00:00:23,261
This has been a perfect portable fan.
这就是我一直想要的便携风扇。

11
00:00:23,262 --> 00:00:25,301
I've been using it when we go to the parks, anywhere.
去公园或者别的地方，我都在用。

12
00:00:25,302 --> 00:00:27,901
Basically wherever Georgia decides to become the surface of the sun.
只要佐治亚州热得像太阳表面一样，就能用上。

13
00:00:27,902 --> 00:00:29,381
And I love how rechargeable it is,
而且它可以充电，我很喜欢，

14
00:00:29,382 --> 00:00:31,261
even on my neck. Or I can actually just take it off and set it,
也能挂在脖子上，或者拿下来放好，

15
00:00:31,262 --> 00:00:34,381
and it just blows at me. It feels so good.
一直对着我吹，真的很舒服。

16
00:00:34,382 --> 00:00:37,361
You're telling me I've been out here sweating for free for no reason?
你的意思是，我之前一直在白白受热、白白流汗？

17
00:00:37,460 --> 00:00:39,060
Pretty much. Okay.
差不多就是这样。——好吧。

18
00:00:39,061 --> 00:00:41,441
Where'd you get it? I got it off the TikTok shop. TikTok?
哪里买的？——TikTok Shop。——TikTok？

19
00:00:41,460 --> 00:00:43,660
I'll send you the link. Send me the link now?
我把链接发你。——现在就发给我。

20
00:00:43,661 --> 00:00:44,421
Yeah, I wouldn't wait.
对，我建议别拖，

21
00:00:44,422 --> 00:00:45,541
I think a bunch of them sold out,
好像不少已经卖完了，

22
00:00:45,542 --> 00:00:46,141
but, I mean,
不过，

23
00:00:46,142 --> 00:00:47,701
I'll send you the link. Hopefully they're still available.
我先把链接发你，希望还有货。

24
00:00:47,702 --> 00:00:48,781
Okay, send me the link right now.
好，现在就发我，

25
00:00:48,782 --> 00:00:50,180
I'm gonna order it right now.
我要立刻下单。
